OL,3,GNEWSATrial hears Tommy Robinson hired
OL,4,Aprivate detectives
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolitical activist Tommy Robinson has
OL,7,Ftold a court he hired private
OL,8,Fdetectives to track down and photograph
OL,9,Ftwo reporters to "put pressure" on
OL,10,Fthem.
OL,12,FThe 43-year-old from Bedfordshire, real
OL,13,Fname Stephen Yaxley-Lennon, was giving
OL,14,Fevidence at Southwark Crown Court and
OL,15,Fsaid he had been "shocked and scared"
OL,16,Fwhen the Daily Mail published a story
OL,17,Faccusing him of "stoking race riots
OL,18,Ffrom his sunbed".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
