OL,3,GNEWSATrial hears Tommy Robinson hired
OL,4,Aprivate detectives
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe denied two charges of harassment
OL,7,Fcausing fear of violence to reporters
OL,8,FAndrew Young and Jacob Dirnhuber after
OL,9,Fthe 2024 Southport attacks.
OL,11,FRobinson is accused of writing posts on
OL,12,FX, sending direct messages and making
OL,13,Fphone calls that made the two
OL,14,Fjournalists fear the risk of vigilante
OL,15,Fattacks.
